# Local Taste Skill Loading

This repository includes Taste Skill files in `skills/`.

Before UI, UX, redesign, image-to-code, mobile screen, animation, or motion tasks:

1. Read `skills/llms.txt`.
2. Choose the relevant skill.
3. Open the matching `skills/<skill-folder>/SKILL.md`.
4. Apply only the parts that fit the Flutter mobile task.
5. Combine Taste Skill guidance with `.agents/instructions/ui-design.instructions.md` and `.agents/skills/ui-design-skill/SKILL.md`.

Default choices:

- Mobile UI concepts and visual direction: `skills/imagegen-frontend-mobile/SKILL.md`
- Existing app screen improvements: `skills/redesign-skill/SKILL.md`
- UI/UX animation and premium motion direction: `skills/gpt-tasteskill/SKILL.md`
- Clean, dense product screens: `skills/minimalist-skill/SKILL.md`
- Premium visual polish: `skills/soft-skill/SKILL.md`
- Image-to-code work: `skills/image-to-code-skill/SKILL.md`
- Complete unabridged code: `skills/output-skill/SKILL.md`
- Broad full-redesign taste guidance: `skills/taste-skill/SKILL.md`

Do not skip local Taste Skill loading when the task touches UI/UX/animation.
